  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Bfc 102.01 \"Board\" means the New Hampshire state board of fire control established as the state advisory board of fire control in RSA 153:2 and also known as the board of fire control in 153:5, I.\n\nSource. #10553-A, eff 3-25-14",
